00:13:40.792 --> 00:13:42.792
let's go take a look at
how the dominos are doing!

00:13:42.792 --> 00:13:44.792
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:52.583
It's so wonderful!
You're just too wonderful, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:13:52.583 --> 00:13:54.833
The sight of you that knows
no compromise makes Excel...

00:13:54.833 --> 00:13:56.583
Excel just adores you for that...

00:13:56.583 --> 00:13:57.458
How electrifying!

00:13:57.458 --> 00:14:01.792
Now! You can laugh or cry,
but it's the final match, Armageddon!

00:14:01.792 --> 00:14:03.458
The feature the West Team
will be submitting is

00:14:03.458 --> 00:14:05.708
about our show's very own super hero!

00:14:05.708 --> 00:14:07.208
Pedro!

00:14:08.792 --> 00:14:11.792
He rushes through the
darker path of life like a gale!

00:14:11.792 --> 00:14:13.625
And finally, this winter,
he'll be appearing on the big screen!

00:14:13.625 --> 00:14:16.083
Please watch this early preview!
Here you go!

00:14:19.333 --> 00:14:22.042
Pedro! Pedro! Pedro!

00:14:22.042 --> 00:14:24.417
"Pedro"

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.333
<i>He had a beloved wife.</i>

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:28.833
<i>He had a son.</i>

00:14:28.833 --> 00:14:30.792
<i>But the man set out on a journey.</i>

00:14:30.792 --> 00:14:32.958
<i>For the sake of Japanese money.</i>

00:14:32.958 --> 00:14:34.125
Papa!

00:14:34.125 --> 00:14:35.583
Sandora!

00:14:36.875 --> 00:14:39.208
Welcome home, Dear.

00:14:39.208 --> 00:14:42.667
Sandora's always so
happy when you come home.

00:14:42.667 --> 00:14:45.250
<i>His family's smiles give him support.</i>

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.833
<i>He thought that his happiness lay there.</i>

00:14:48.833 --> 00:14:49.042
"...However"

00:14:49.042 --> 00:14:53.042
<i>However, he falls to the mercy of fate.</i>

00:14:53.042 --> 00:14:55.958
It's hot! It's hot!

00:14:57.292 --> 00:14:59.833
Coming and going between
this world and that,

00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:02.875
the man changes his
form into that of a ghost.

00:15:02.875 --> 00:15:05.375
Mr. Pedro... Mr. Pedro!

00:15:06.208 --> 00:15:08.208
Sandora!

00:15:08.208 --> 00:15:09.333
Welcome home!

00:15:09.333 --> 00:15:09.792
Welcome home!

00:15:09.792 --> 00:15:11.333
I'm home!

00:15:11.333 --> 00:15:13.333
Oh, you.

00:15:13.333 --> 00:15:15.125
Dear!

00:15:15.125 --> 00:15:16.625
W-Why?!

00:15:18.542 --> 00:15:21.958
No! He does not understand me!

00:15:21.958 --> 00:15:24.708
It doesn't matter! Pedro doesn't
exist in my heart anymore!

00:15:24.708 --> 00:15:26.542
Not even a trace!

00:15:26.542 --> 00:15:30.750
Double shock!
And twin waterfalls of tears!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:35.875
You can pick up love off the
ground anywhere. Even here.

00:15:35.875 --> 00:15:37.542
Ms. Will!

00:15:37.542 --> 00:15:40.375
You took my woman!
How dare you tell me to calm down?!

00:15:40.375 --> 00:15:41.958
So, I'm saying...

00:15:41.958 --> 00:15:44.542
That's "I'm sorry", right?! Hey?!

00:15:44.542 --> 00:15:46.042
Friendship...

00:15:48.083 --> 00:15:49.583
Guarandoo!

00:15:49.583 --> 00:15:51.083
Betrayal...

00:15:52.333 --> 00:15:53.125
What's wrong?!

00:15:53.125 --> 00:15:54.000
Mama!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.125
You aren't...

00:15:56.125 --> 00:15:58.083
It looks like it.

00:15:58.083 --> 00:16:00.917
Why?! The numbers don't add up!

00:16:00.917 --> 00:16:02.417
True love...

00:16:03.417 --> 00:16:05.083
Ms. Will.

00:16:05.083 --> 00:16:05.583
--No! No!

00:16:05.583 --> 00:16:07.458
--The wandering soul, Pedro!
--No! No!

00:16:07.458 --> 00:16:10.167
--Go, go, Pedro! In your own way!
--No! No!

00:16:10.292 --> 00:16:11.083
"Pedro"

00:16:11.083 --> 00:16:11.958
"Pedro"
Pedro!

00:16:11.958 --> 00:16:14.625
"Coming to Theaters Sometime"
All you can do now is watch over him!

00:16:14.625 --> 00:16:16.083
"Coming to Theaters Sometime ...Maybe"
All you can do now is watch over him!

00:16:16.167 --> 00:16:18.083
One more, you idiot!

00:16:20.542 --> 00:16:20.667
--Well, what unnecessary great popularity!

00:16:20.667 --> 00:16:21.750
--Thanks.
--Well, what unnecessary great popularity!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.250
What'll happen next?!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.917
Well, the East Team
can't let them steal the show.

00:16:26.917 --> 00:16:29.125
We also have someone
who was not in the original work.

00:16:29.125 --> 00:16:30.292
--A star risen from the television show!

00:16:30.292 --> 00:16:31.500
--You don't mean...
--A star risen from the television show!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.458
Using his status as the director,
he barges into the drama

00:16:34.458 --> 00:16:36.958
with a wasteful afro and
a nihilistic ulterior motive!

00:16:36.958 --> 00:16:38.833
Yes, his name is...

00:16:38.833 --> 00:16:40.250
Nabeshin!

00:16:41.458 --> 00:16:45.208
"Nabeshin"

00:16:45.208 --> 00:16:47.583
I said, drink your soup!

00:16:50.417 --> 00:16:53.625
<i>My name is Shinichi Watanabe,</i>
<i>better known as Nabeshin.</i>

00:16:53.625 --> 00:16:56.792
<i>An anime director that</i>
<i>wants to straddle the world.</i>

00:16:56.792 --> 00:17:00.333
<i>And my partners are so cool too!</i>

00:17:00.333 --> 00:17:04.708
<i>Antonio, a cool innkeeper</i>
<i>that won't miss any prey he targets.</i>

00:17:05.833 --> 00:17:10.792
<i>Space Butler the 13th.</i>
<i>He'll even chop the cute Puchuus in half.</i>

00:17:10.792 --> 00:17:13.375
<i>The mystery woman,</i>
<i>Tetsuko with the iron mask.</i>

00:17:13.375 --> 00:17:16.958
<i>It's a face you've seen somewhere,</i>
<i>but you just can't hate her.</i>

00:17:17.708 --> 00:17:20.750
Nabeshin, how dare you kill me?!

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.167
Hey, it's Old Man Rikdo!

00:17:26.625 --> 00:17:29.833
<i>Well, I'll gather up those</i>
<i>idiots with a quirk or two</i>

00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:32.833
<i>and let's see what scene</i>
<i>we'll barge into next!</i>

00:17:32.833 --> 00:17:34.500
I'll tickle you!

00:17:37.667 --> 00:17:40.000
Intensive training with all your might!

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.500
He's turning... That was quick.

00:17:44.458 --> 00:17:48.208
"Nabeshin"

00:17:48.208 --> 00:17:50.875
Oh, I don't have money, okay? No money.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:55.750
--You stand out too much!
--Mr. Nabeshin, what are your interests?

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.708
--There are limits, even for directors!
--Afro...

00:17:57.708 --> 00:18:00.750
Now both teams have
exhibited their hidden talents.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.625
Let's announce the final results!

00:18:02.625 --> 00:18:05.917
First, the West Team! 10 pts!
10 pts! 10 pts! 10 pts! 10 pts!

00:18:05.917 --> 00:18:08.417
All right! The max of fifty points!

00:18:08.417 --> 00:18:12.208
Next, for the East Team. 10 pts, 10 pts...

00:18:12.208 --> 00:18:14.167
We got the maximum points as well!

00:18:14.958 --> 00:18:16.542
Would you believe it?!

00:18:16.542 --> 00:18:18.167
We are tied! It's a draw!

00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:20.417
It seems that we won't
be having a victor this year.

00:18:20.417 --> 00:18:24.000
Don't say it like there's going
to be a next year, Hatchan!

00:18:26.042 --> 00:18:27.750
Was that good?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.208
Yeah, that was fine! Good job!

