00:22:15.042 --> 00:22:17.958
Sorry about that. Oh, fade out there.

00:22:17.958 --> 00:22:20.500
This world is corrupt!

00:22:24.167 --> 00:22:25.500
"No scene again..."

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:29.000
"No scene again..."
"For us..."

00:23:59.042 --> 00:24:00.292
When a show gets to this point,

00:24:00.292 --> 00:24:02.375
sometimes both the viewers and
the creators start getting used to it.

00:24:02.375 --> 00:24:04.042
All those nights we were
enthused, excited, and smeared

00:24:04.042 --> 00:24:05.208
are now completely <i>passe</i>!

00:24:05.208 --> 00:24:07.167
In search of stimulus, are you
leaping into romantic adventures

00:24:07.167 --> 00:24:09.000
and asking Monta for advice
in the middle of the day, Ma'am?!

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.917
A new character is
appearing who'll blow away

00:24:10.917 --> 00:24:12.875
that sense of ennui,
and her name is Ropponmatsu!

00:24:12.875 --> 00:24:14.125
On the outside,
she's cool and beautiful,

00:24:14.125 --> 00:24:15.417
but on the inside,
she's a robot, a machine.

00:24:15.417 --> 00:24:16.667
A dadadda kind of character!

00:24:16.667 --> 00:24:18.417
So, even Dad will love this!
One for every family!

00:24:18.417 --> 00:24:20.125
For the cultivation of
aesthetics in your children!

00:24:20.125 --> 00:24:21.750
A companion for conquest!
For a lonely night!

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:23.042
Antarctica, no, I mean, Ropponmatsu!

00:24:23.042 --> 00:24:28.594
